# ExpenseFlow — Monorepo Root
#
# Environment variables for each application live in their own package:
#
#   Backend:  apps/backend/.env  (see apps/backend/.env.example)
#   Frontend: apps/frontend/.env (Vite — see Vite docs for VITE_ prefix rules)
#
# Copy the relevant .env.example to .env and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env files to version control.
